    "architecture_impact": "diagram_change",
    "impact_reason": "Integrated review-health behavior adds five source-linked Function nodes and seven Code relationships for authoritative forge evidence, actionable repair routing, fresh closeout verification and Task observation metadata. This review adds a component relationship exposing Watchdog-to-Task observation in both supervisor/team views, preserves native Code ownership, updates the Watchdog behavior flow and root health summary, and documents same-Feature selection explicitly. System/context and container/store boundaries are unchanged. Publication pins the reviewed current plan and integrated committed model/design; the earlier pending request and accepted snapshots are preserved. Final Feature 4 integration, complete repair/retirement and cross-Feature dependency acceptance remain outstanding. Validation passed 73 lifecycle and 40 C4 checks, rendered source kinds/owners and five actual context-to-Code, deep-link, pinned-source and Level-up journeys; both component views expose the observation edge and warm navigation reuses render artifacts."
